  EscalationPacket, PhaseCheckpoint) were defined inside their already-assigned
  matrix modules — no new module files were introduced (no drift vs plan §8).
- Secure gates: post-proposal/post-architecture/post-blueprint fire AFTER their
  phase; pre-deployment fires BEFORE the deployment phase (proposal §7). YOLO
  skips user-facing gates but keeps internal controls (FR-OM-002).

